I don't think I ever learned the difference between being stressed out and being
mad at someone. Everything thinks I'm terrible. Everyone cries themselves to
sleep,,, right?? Everyone is stressed out. I don't think we want to be calm. We
are realizing that we need to do something to fix some certain specific
problems, and we are overwhelmed because we see the enormity of the task and we
naturally orient ourselves around that. Instead, we should see our allies, our
fellows we work on the problem with, but that's so hard. so rare. this is our
trials and travailles, finding the ways to reconnect when we lost our way, and
forgot how. The internet has taken much from us, but only because of the way we
designed it. There are better designs that orient ourselves to each other, and
not toward the world, which is so large it crushes us. We can be less stressed
out. We can find ways to love me again.
